    r"Verify character cancellation by a substitution that multiplies the sum by $y^{rj_0}=-1$, then split the transform by the top address bit.",
    r"The ring has zero divisors, so the usual argument of dividing by $\omega_t^j-1$ is unavailable and cancellation must be checked directly.",
    "explicit",
